        "created_at": "2013-08-07T20:53:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ronway's questions, answer number 1!</p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/answers-to-debated-questions-3871\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/answers-to-debated-questions-3871</a></p><p><strong>1. Do you choose a target while using Jack Handle?</strong></p><p>No, it is an automatic effect, so you will read strike as \"do all non-hero targets 1 melee damage\" or any other damage he can do pretty much. So targeting Fixer when he has Bloody Knuckles doesn't cause Fixer to deal out 5 melee damage to all non-hero targets.</p>",
